1. [ ] Setup FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + PostgreSQL (Docker Compose).
2. [ ] Implement Task CRUD (Contract Match with Frontend).
3. [ ] Configure WebSocket Manager for multi-client broadcasting.
4. [ ] Setup RabbitMQ Consumer for external analytics simulation.
